 seen the sun for days. Noon looks much like evening here, and washing won't dry in a week.","zh":"这里好几天没见着太阳了，晌午跟傍晚差不多。晾的衣服一个礼拜都不干。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk9.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk9"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk9.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk9"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk10","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Fiona Mothhold","zh":"菲奥娜·蛾堡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"palefen.reedholm.home-5","x":1,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":11,"household":"palefen.reedholm.h4","purse":1,"favourite":"item/food/egg/boiled"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["palefen.reedholm.folk10.coin0"],"look":{"body":"girl","parts":{"hair":"hair.childbob","face":"face.child","outfit":"outfit.smock","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"umber","eyes":"leaf","outfit.1":"teal","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-5","x":1,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":18,"y":18,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-5","x":5,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":18,"y":18,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":25,"y":18,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"My mum says I can't go out after dark because something out there takes children. Have you ever seen one?","zh":"我娘说天黑了不许出门，外面有东西会把小孩叼走。你见过那种东西吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Can you hop to the well and back on one foot? I can. I did twenty hops without switching.","zh":"你能单脚跳到井边再跳回来吗？我能，我跳了二十下都没换脚。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Keep to the boards and stay out of the mud. And if you hear anything from the graveyard at night, don't go and look.","zh":"走路踩着木板走，别下到泥里。还有，夜里墓地那边要是有动静，别过去看。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk10.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk10"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk11","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Colm Eelstone","zh":"科尔姆·鳗石"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"palefen.reedholm","x":10,"y":21},"facing":"down","props":{"age":30,"household":"palefen.reedholm.h5","purse":5,"favourite":"item/light/candle"},"contents":["palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin0","palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin1","palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin2","palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin3","palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin4"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.messy","face":"face.stern","mark":"mark.freckles","glasses":"glasses.round","hat":"hat.straw","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"umber","eyes":"bark","glasses.1":"iron","hat.1":"mustard","outfit.1":"undyed","outfit.2":"moss","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":6,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-6","x":3,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":6,"to":12,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":10,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-6","x":7,"y":2,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":10,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":24,"y":16,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"I want these rows hoed by noon. This afternoon I'm helping next door mend their pigsty. I promised.","zh":"我得趁上午把这几垄锄完。下午要去帮邻居家修猪圈，早就说好了的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wheat came into ear nearly half a month late this year, and the ears are thin. My father farmed forty years and says he never saw the like.","zh":"今年的麦子抽穗晚了快半个月，穗子也瘪。我爹种了四十年地，说从没见过这样的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"We haven't seen the sun for days. Noon looks much like evening here, and washing won't dry in a week.","zh":"这里好几天没见着太阳了，晌午跟傍晚差不多。晾的衣服一个礼拜都不干。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk11"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk11"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk11"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk11"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk11.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk11"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk12","type":"actor/person/villager","name":{"en":"Niall Eelstone","zh":"尼尔·鳗石"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"palefen.reedholm","x":8,"y":25},"facing":"down","props":{"age":51,"household":"palefen.reedholm.h5","purse":4,"favourite":"item/food/fish/catfish"},"contents":["palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin0","palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin1","palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin2","palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin3"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.swept","face":"face.weary","beard":"beard.stubble","glasses":"glasses.round","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"black","eyes":"bark","glasses.1":"gold","outfit.1":"linen","outfit.2":"moss","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"villager","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":5,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-6","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":8,"y":25,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-6","x":6,"y":2,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":8,"y":25,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":24,"y":11,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"You're not from here, are you? There have been more people on the road than usual lately. They say the Church is calling for pilgrims.","zh":"你是外地来的吧？这阵子路上的人比往年多，听说是教会在召朝圣的人。"}},{"key":"hour:evening","text":{"en":"Done at last. I'll fetch a bucket from the well, and then there's supper to make for the whole house.","zh":"活总算干完了。我去井边打桶水，回来还得给一家子做饭。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Keep to the boards and stay out of the mud. And if you hear anything from the graveyard at night, don't go and look.","zh":"走路踩着木板走，别下到泥里。还有，夜里墓地那边要是有动静，别过去看。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk12"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk12"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk12"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk12.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk12"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk13","type":"actor/person/beggar","name":{"en":"Kieran Crowcroft","zh":"基兰·鸦园"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":1,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":38,"household":"palefen.reedholm.h6","purse":0,"favourite":"item/food/fish/catfish"},"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.ponytail","face":"face.bright","glasses":"glasses.round","hat":"hat.cap","outfit":"outfit.tunic","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"black","eyes":"sky","glasses.1":"iron","hat.1":"umber","outfit.1":"undyed","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"beggar","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":7,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":1,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":12,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":12,"y":21,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Spare a coin, please, or a crust of bread. Even the soup tent has been shut these past few days.","zh":"行行好，给一枚钱吧，一块干面包也行。这几天连施粥的棚子都关了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Keep to the boards and stay out of the mud. And if you hear anything from the graveyard at night, don't go and look.","zh":"走路踩着木板走，别下到泥里。还有，夜里墓地那边要是有动静，别过去看。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk14","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Ciara Crowcroft","zh":"基娅拉·鸦园"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":1,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":8,"household":"palefen.reedholm.h6","purse":1,"favourite":"item/misc/doll"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["palefen.reedholm.folk14.coin0"],"look":{"body":"girl","parts":{"hair":"hair.pigtails","face":"face.child","outfit":"outfit.smock","shoes":"shoes.shoes"},"colors":{"skin":"fair","hair":"umber","eyes":"bark","outfit.1":"linen","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":1,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":25,"y":24,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":6,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":25,"y":24,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-7","x":6,"y":4,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Can you hop to the well and back on one foot? I can. I did twenty hops without switching.","zh":"你能单脚跳到井边再跳回来吗？我能，我跳了二十下都没换脚。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Keep to the boards and stay out of the mud. And if you hear anything from the graveyard at night, don't go and look.","zh":"走路踩着木板走，别下到泥里。还有，夜里墓地那边要是有动静，别过去看。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk14.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk14"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk15","type":"actor/person/villager","name":{"en":"Una Eelbrook","zh":"乌娜·鳗溪"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"palefen.reedholm","x":36,"y":17},"facing":"down","props":{"age":52,"household":"palefen.reedholm.h7","purse":3,"favourite":"item/food/chicken/cooked"},"contents":["palefen.reedholm.folk15.coin0","palefen.reedholm.folk15.coin1","palefen.reedholm.folk15.coin2"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.tied","face":"face.soft","outfit":"outfit.shawl","shoes":"shoes.buckled"},"colors":{"skin":"deep","hair":"umber","eyes":"sky","outfit.1":"plum","outfit.2":"steelgrey","shoes.1":"black"}},"npc":{"role":"villager","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":5,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-8","x":1,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":36,"y":17,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-8","x":3,"y":5,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"palefen.reedholm","x":36,"y":17,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"palefen.reedholm.home-8","x":3,"y":5,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Up already? The bakery isn't open yet. I want the first batch; flour is short, and by mid-morning there's nothing left.","zh":"这么早就起了？面包房还没开门呢。我得赶第一炉，这阵子面粉紧，晚了就买不着了。"}},{"key":"hour:evening","text":{"en":"Done at last. I'll fetch a bucket from the well, and then there's supper to make for the whole house.","zh":"活总算干完了。我去井边打桶水，回来还得给一家子做饭。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Keep to the boards and stay out of the mud. And if you hear anything from the graveyard at night, don't go and look.","zh":"走路踩着木板走，别下到泥里。还有，夜里墓地那边要是有动静，别过去看。"}}]}}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk15.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk15"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk15.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk15"}},{"id":"palefen.reedholm.folk15.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"palefen.reedholm.folk15"}}]}